+
+## Due times
+
+With `DUE_TIMES=on`, all ticket responses include `due`, an ISO timestamp assigned from creation
+time plus the configured response hours. It stays fixed when priority or settings change.
+`GET /tickets?overdue=true` returns cursor pages of only open and in-progress tickets whose due
+time is strictly before the current time. Existing filters and pagination still apply.
+`overdue=false` leaves the listing unrestricted; other overdue values return 400. With the flag
+off, ticket responses omit `due` and the overdue parameter is ignored as before.
